Instead of printing directly everywhere, define functions like:

```perl
sub logmsg {
    print scalar localtime() . " @_\n";
}

sub logerr {
    print STDERR scalar localtime() . " ERROR: @_\n";
}

sub debug {
    return unless $debug;
    print scalar localtime() . " DEBUG: @_\n";
}
```

Then use:

